{"vid":"Pbef2JRXf0c","source":"Pbef2JRXf0c.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":14.3,"txt":">> There is a permit that is required to go"},{"t":16.8,"txt":"into a confined space and it's more than"},{"t":20,"txt":"just a permission slip. It also helps"},{"t":22.7,"txt":"guide the entry team in getting the job"},{"t":25,"txt":"done safely."},{"t":27.2,"txt":"On this entry permit, you'll find the"},{"t":30,"txt":"location and nature of the confined"},{"t":32.5,"txt":"space,"},{"t":33.8,"txt":"the reason for the entry, and the date"},{"t":36.7,"txt":"and authorized duration of the"},{"t":38.6,"txt":"entry."},{"t":40.5,"txt":"The permit must also identify the entry"},{"t":43.3,"txt":"supervisor, entrance, and"},{"t":45.7,"txt":"attendants who have been approved to"},{"t":47.9,"txt":"work on the job."},{"t":49.8,"txt":"Each of these roles has distinct"},{"t":51.9,"txt":"responsibilities."},{"t":54.4,"txt":"An entrant is an employee who is"},{"t":56.8,"txt":"authorized by their employer to enter a"},{"t":59.6,"txt":"permit-required confined space."},{"t":62.2,"txt":">>"},{"t":63.6,"txt":">> An entry supervisor is typically a more"},{"t":66.7,"txt":"experienced senior-level employee and is"},{"t":69.9,"txt":"responsible for preparing for and"},{"t":72.3,"txt":"overseeing the confined space"},{"t":74,"txt":"work."},{"t":75.9,"txt":"An attendant is someone who is stationed"},{"t":78.2,"txt":"outside of the confined space to monitor"},{"t":81,"txt":"the entrance as they work."},{"t":84,"txt":"In addition to the basic information"},{"t":86.2,"txt":"about the confined space operation, an"},{"t":89,"txt":"entry permit will also identify each of"},{"t":91.8,"txt":"the hazards associated with the confined"},{"t":94.7,"txt":"space"},{"t":95.9,"txt":"and the measures that will be taken to"},{"t":98.7,"txt":"isolate,"},{"t":99.5,"txt":"control, or eliminate them."},{"t":102.3,"txt":"It will specify what conditions have to"},{"t":104.9,"txt":"exist inside the space before it can be"},{"t":108,"txt":"entered as well."},{"t":110.8,"txt":"The permit will also list the personal"},{"t":113.2,"txt":"protective equipment that should"},{"t":114.8,"txt":"be worn when working in the space."},{"t":117.8,"txt":"It will include details on any"},{"t":119.7,"txt":"communications gear, atmospheric"},{"t":122.2,"txt":"monitors, and alarm systems"},{"t":124.5,"txt":">>"},{"t":124.5,"txt":">> that need to be used in the space as"},{"t":126.7,"txt":"well."},{"t":128.6,"txt":"But, PPE can't always prevent injuries."},{"t":132.5,"txt":"So, the permit will also contain the"},{"t":134.7,"txt":"contact information for local rescue"},{"t":137.4,"txt":"squads, police, and fire stations, as"},{"t":140.8,"txt":"well as a list of any emergency"},{"t":142.8,"txt":"equipment that must be on hand"},{"t":145,"txt":"during the entry."},{"t":147.4,"txt":"Sometimes, additional documents, such as"},{"t":149.8,"txt":"a hot work permit, are required for the"},{"t":152.5,"txt":"work to proceed."},{"t":154.2,"txt":"In this case, the entry permit will list"},{"t":157,"txt":"them, too."},{"t":159.2,"txt":"A permit must be signed by the entry"},{"t":161.8,"txt":"supervisor before the job associated"},{"t":164.4,"txt":"with it begins. It will then remain"},{"t":167.2,"txt":"valid until the project is"},{"t":169.1,"txt":"either completed or a condition arises"},{"t":172,"txt":"that is prohibited by the permit, such"},{"t":174.8,"txt":"as a low oxygen level."},{"t":177.6,"txt":"In this case, the work in the"},{"t":179.2,"txt":"space is stopped, and the space is"},{"t":181.8,"txt":"evacuated."},{"t":184.2,"txt":"Details of any problems that occurred"},{"t":186.4,"txt":"during the entry must be recorded on the"},{"t":188.8,"txt":"permit, so they can be studied later to"},{"t":191.7,"txt":"help make future jobs safer."},{"t":194.5,"txt":"Entry permits from completed jobs"},{"t":196.5,"txt":"must be kept on file for at"},{"t":198.6,"txt":"least 1 year."}],"words":[{"t":14.28,"w":">>"},{"t":14.2